    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Behan Irwin & Gosling are delighted to offer for sale this excellent three bedroom end of terrace property, ideally situated in the charming coastal village of Whitegate in East Cork.  Whitegate is a scenic and welcoming community located along the shores of Cork Harbour known for it's peaceful surroundings and strong sense of village life. The village offers a range of local amenities including shops, cafés, schools and recreational facilities, while also being within easy reach of nearby towns such as Midleton, Cloyne and the popular seaside area of Trabolgan.\r\nResidents benefit from a balance of coastal living and convenient access to larger retail centres, services, and transport links to Cork."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway (5.49m X 2.25m)\r\nAntique tiled flooring, radiator, light switch, centre light, internet point, smoke alarm and 4 power points. \r\n\r\nLiving Room (5.48m X 5.38m) \r\nSolid fuel fire place with matching hearth & mantle, PVC double glazed windows, Curtains/curtain rails, hardwood timber flooring, radiator,  cornicing to ceiling, centre light internet point and 6 power points.\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.52m x 2.72m)\r\nPVC double glazed window, tiled flooring, Whirlpool 4 plate hob and Indesit oven/grill, extractor hood, matching mixer drainer, breakfast bar to the centre of the room, shelving units throughout, radiator, centre light and 10 power points.\r\n\r\nGuest bathroom (3.28m x 2.12m)\r\nWC, WHB, wall mounted mirror feature, stainless steel splash back, tiled flooring, floor to eye level helving unit, 2 centre lights and a radiator.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (3.28m X 2.64m)\r\nFloor finished in tiles, stainless steel sink & mixer tap and drainer incorporating floor to eye level storage units above and below, radiator, centre light, PVC double glazed window and door to back garden.\r\n\r\nStairs to Landing\r\nFully carpeted stairs and landing, access to the attic through the landing, PVC double glazed window with frosted finish, centre light and light switches.\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom  (5.49m X 5.45m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, PVC double glazed windows overlooking the front of the property, original fireplace with matching hearth & mantle, wall length fitted wardrobes with hanging and storage space, blinds, centre light and 10 power points.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (2.38m X 1.85m)\r\nTiled floor and partially tiled walls, WC, WHB, electric shower, PVC double glazed windows with frosted privacy cover, wall mounted light feature, shelving unit, extractor fan and towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.92m X 4.16m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, solid fuel open fireplace with matching hearth & mantle, radiator, PVC double glazed window facing the front of the property, smoke alarm, centre light and 8 power points.\r\n\r\nEnsuite ( 1.62m X 1.56m)\r\nFully complete three-piece suite, WC, WHB & electric shower, extractor fan, shelving unit, PVC double glazed window with frosted privacy cover, tiled splash back, towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (4.20m X 3.29m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, PVC double glazed windows facing the side of the property, skirting boards, light switch and 8 power points.\r\n\r\nMain bathroom (2.79m X 2.70m)\r\nTiled floor covering with a timber wall surround, WC, WHB, electric shower/ bathtub, tiled splash back, wall mounted light unit, towel rain & centre light.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nGarden laid out in mix of pebble and grass to the rear of the property, high private walls ensuring total privacy. On street parking directly to the front  of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious 3 bed end of terrace dwelling\r\nSituated in a picturesque location in Whitegate adjacent Cloyne & Midleton.\r\nIdeal property for first time buyer/owner occupiers.\r\nFeatures include beautiful high ceilings, private rear garden and PVC windows throughout.\r\nEligible for the vacant property refurbishment grant of €50,000."
      },
      {
